      "expected_verdict": "benign",
      "label": {
        "kind": "ops-soc-judgment",
        "basis": "Recorded parent chain in this dataset: NetworkWatcherAgent.exe (C:\\Packages\\Plugins\\Microsoft.Azure.NetworkWatcher.NetworkWatcherAgentWindows\\...) runs netsh trace; netsh starts cscript C:\\windows\\system32\\gatherNetworkInfo.vbs as WORKSTATION5$, which runs cmd /c reg export of network, wireless and credential-provider configuration into a config folder. Judged benign Azure VM network diagnostics collection; OTRF metadata describes only the Empire activity in this dataset. The exports run minutes from the Empire persistence activity on the same host, which makes the case harder."
      },
